      "writtenOn": "2010-10-04T19:11:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t seem quite right.  If this were a private method called only in pollStateDone(), it would be fine.  But it can also be called from GsmPhone in response to EVENT_ICC_RECORDS_EONS_UPDATED.  My two issues with that:  1) Seems a bit circular (SimRecords -\u003e GsmPhone -\u003e GsmSST -\u003e SimRecords); and 2) In that code path, ss is updated but phone.notifyServiceStateChanged() is not called, so no apps are notified of the operator name change.",
      "revId": "fff5d2bdddc337e0343b8daba8c8a6c1c79be319",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
